+History
+=======
+These are the major (and not so major) changes in each release, along with the
+functions/options that are introduced/affected by them. There are other little
+tweaks and fixes made along the way too.
+
+2.4.13 - 9/9/2026
+-----------------
+* Simpler channel mapping setting
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetMap
+	SPEAKERS example updated
+* Matrix resetting to defaults
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetMatrix
+* Matrix changes are ramped by default
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetMatrix
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetMap
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelFlags
+* Option to disable ramping of volume/pan/matrix changes
+	BASS_MIXER_CHAN_NORAMP (BASS_ChannelFlags flag)
+* Ramping-out when pausing
+	BASS_MIXER_CHAN_RAMPOUT (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex flag)
+	BASS_MIXER_CHAN_PAUSE (BASS_ChannelFlags flag)
+* Stalled sources are ramped-in when resuming by default
+	BASS_MIXER_CHAN_NORAMPIN (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex flag)
+* Syncs for any stalled mixer sources
+	BASS_SYNC_MIXER_STALL (BASS_ChannelSetSync type)
+	BASS_SYNC_MIXER_RESUME (BASS_ChannelSetSync type)
+* Accounting for custom output latency on non-mixtime syncs
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetSync
+* Callback system for providing custom output latency
+	BASS_Mixer_StreamSetLatency
+	MIXERLATENCYPROC
+* DSP-based splitting/cloning with support for non-decoding channels
+	BASS_SPLIT_DSP (BASS_Split_StreamCreate flag)
+	BASS_CONFIG_SPLIT_PRIORITY (BASS_SetConfig option)
+	BASS_ATTRIB_SPLIT_PRIORITY (BASS_ChannelSetAttribute option)
+* Splitter buffers that overflow only drop the excess old data instead of whole buffer
+	BASS_CONFIG_SPLIT_BUFFER (BASS_SetConfig option)
+* Splitter auto-resetting when seeking
+	BASS_SPLIT_AUTORESET (BASS_Split_StreamCreate flag)
+* Splitters only use their source's loop settings
+	BASS_SAMPLE_LOOP (BASS_ChannelFlags flag)
+	BASS_POS_LOOP (BASS_ChannelSetPosition mode)
+* Thread-specific config options
+	BASS_CONFIG_THREAD (BASS_SetConfig flag)
+	BASS_CONFIG_MIXER_BUFFER (BASS_SetConfig option)
+	BASS_CONFIG_MIXER_POSEX (BASS_SetConfig option)
+	BASS_CONFIG_SPLIT_BUFFER (BASS_SetConfig option)
+* A few small default downmixing matrix tweaks
+	BASS_MIXER_CHAN_DOWNMIX (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex flag)
+* New source auto-freeing flag (same value as BASS_STREAM_AUTOFREE for back-compatibility)
+	BASS_MIXER_CHAN_AUTOFREE (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex flag)
+* Fix for envelope end syncs and source removal when setting envelope position at/beyond the end
+	BASS_SYNC_MIXER_ENVELOPE (BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetSync type)
+	BASS_MIXER_ENV_REMOVE (BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetEnvelope flag)
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetEnvelopePos
+* 128 point rate conversion limit removed on Android/iOS
+	BASS_ATTRIB_SRC (BASS_ChannelSetAttribute option)
+* Old deprecated flags removed from headers
+	BASS_MIXER_BUFFER
+	BASS_MIXER_LIMIT
+	BASS_MIXER_MATRIX
+	BASS_MIXER_PAUSE
+	BASS_MIXER_DOWNMIX
+	BASS_MIXER_NORAMPIN
+
+2.4.12 - 9/8/2022
+-----------------
+* Mixer master volume control
+	BASS_ATTRIB_MIXER_VOL (BASS_ChannelSetAttribute option)
+* Queued mixers for playing sources one at a time
+	BASS_MIXER_QUEUE (BASS_Mixer_StreamCreate flag)
+	BASS_SYNC_MIXER_QUEUE (BASS_ChannelSetSync type)
+* Option to ignore speaker arrangement
+	BASS_MIXER_NOSPEAKER (BASS_Mixer_StreamCreate flag)
+* Matrix initialization for remapping differing multi-channel sources and mixers
+	BASS_MIXER_CHAN_MATRIX (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex flag)
+* Downmixing support for multi-channel mixers
+	BASS_MIXER_CHAN_DOWNMIX (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex flag)
+* Downmixing can be toggled together with SPEAKER flags
+	BASS_MIXER_CHAN_DOWNMIX (BASS_Mixer_ChannelFlags flag)
+* Ramping-in skipped when a source's data begins at a low level
+	BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel
+	BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannelEx
+* Mixer length retrieval
+	BASS_ChannelGetLength
+* SSE is required on x86 platforms
+
+2.4.11 - 23/9/2021
+------------------
+* Multi-threaded mixing
+	BASS_ATTRIB_MIXER_THREADS (BASS_ChannelSetAttribute option)
+* Submixers use parent mixer's latency in source position/data/level retrieval
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetPosition
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetData
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetLevel
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetLevelEx
+* Mixer source status retrieval
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelIsActive
+* Mixer source start delay retrieval
+	BASS_POS_MIXER_DELAY (BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetPosition mode)
+* Lower CPU usage for matrix mixing when each input goes to a single output in sequence
+	BASS_MIXER_MATRIX (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex flag)
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetMatrix
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetMatrixEx
+* macOS examples rewritten in Objective-C/Cocoa
+
+2.4.10 - 20/3/2020
+------------------
+* Mixer source flags renamed to distinguish from mixer flags
+	BASS_MIXER_BUFFER -> BASS_MIXER_CHAN_BUFFER
+	BASS_MIXER_LIMIT -> BASS_MIXER_CHAN_LIMIT
+	BASS_MIXER_MATRIX -> BASS_MIXER_CHAN_MATRIX
+	BASS_MIXER_PAUSE -> BASS_MIXER_CHAN_PAUSE
+	BASS_MIXER_DOWNMIX -> BASS_MIXER_CHAN_DOWNMIX
+	BASS_MIXER_NORAMPIN -> BASS_MIXER_CHAN_NORAMPIN
+* Absolute source start position option
+	BASS_MIXER_CHAN_ABSOLUTE (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannelEx flag)
+* Improved gapless joins with sources that don't end/begin close to a 0 sample
+	BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel
+	BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannelEx
+* 7th and 8th channels are included in a downmix
+	BASS_MIXER_CHAN_DOWNMIX (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex flag)
+* Asynchronous source auto-freeing
+	BASS_STREAM_AUTOFREE (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex flag)
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelRemove
+* Source removal at the end of an envelope
+	BASS_MIXER_ENV_REMOVE (BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetEnvelope flag)
+* Support for relative seeking
+	BASS_POS_RELATIVE (BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetPosition flag)
+* Volume & panning attribute affected level retrieval
+	BASS_LEVEL_VOLPAN (BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetLevelEx flag)
+* Data/level retrieval dips into played data when not enough unplayed data
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetData
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetLevel
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetLevelEx
+* Support for splitting/cloning dummy streams
+	BASS_Split_StreamCreate
+
+2.4.9 - 30/8/2017
+-----------------
+* Asynchronous buffering for splitters
+	BASS_ATTRIB_SPLIT_ASYNCBUFFER (BASS_ChannelSetAttribute option)
+	BASS_ATTRIB_SPLIT_ASYNCPERIOD (BASS_ChannelSetAttribute option)
+* Splitter position/length based on splitter (rather than source) channel count
+	BASS_SPLIT_POS (BASS_Split_StreamCreate flag)
+* Mixer playback buffer flushing when seeking
+	BASS_POS_MIXER_RESET (BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetPosition flag)
+* Retrieval of a mixer's sources
+	BASS_Mixer_StreamGetChannels
+* Removal of 32 channel limit for matix mixing sources
+	BASS_MIXER_MATRIX (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex flag)
+
+2.4.8 - 13/3/2015
+-----------------
+* Accounting for custom output latency in source position/data/level retrieval
+	BASS_ATTRIB_MIXER_LATENCY (BASS_ChannelSetAttribute option)
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetPosition
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetData
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetLevel
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetLevelEx
+* Ramped matrix changes
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetMatrixEx
+* Speaker assignment with matrix mixing
+	BASS_SPEAKER_xxx (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex and BASS_Mixer_ChannelFlags flags)
+* Extended level retrieval support
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetLevelEx
+* Absolute source buffer length option
+	BASS_CONFIG_MIXER_BUFFER
+* Length of resampled output rounded to nearest sample
+
+2.4.7 - 8/5/2012
+----------------
+* Improved and adjustable sample rate conversion quality
+	BASS_ATTRIB_SRC (BASS_ChannelSetAttribute option)
+* Additional filtering option removed (superseded by BASS_ATTRIB_SRC)
+	BASS_MIXER_FILTER
+	BASS_CONFIG_MIXER_FILTER
+
+2.4.6 - 26/9/2011
+-----------------
+* Retrieval of all splitters set on a channel
+	BASS_Split_StreamGetSplits
+* "Slave" splitters that only read buffered data (not directly from the source)
+	BASS_SPLIT_SLAVE (BASS_Split_StreamCreate flag)
+* Splitter buffer length is now unrestricted
+	BASS_CONFIG_SPLIT_BUFFER
+* Splitter position now available immediately following creation of the splitter
+	BASS_ChannelGetPosition
+* Envelope node syncs
+	BASS_SYNC_MIXER_ENVELOPE_NODE (BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetSync type)
+* Limiting of envelope syncs to a particular envelope type
+	BASS_SYNC_MIXER_ENVELOPE (BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetSync type)
+	BASS_SYNC_MIXER_ENVELOPE_NODE (BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetSync type)
+* More precise mixer sample rate conversion
+* Xcode examples project added for OSX
+
+2.4.5 - 17/12/2010
+------------------
+* Accounting for latency when getting the position of a mixer source
+	BASS_MIXER_POSEX (BASS_Mixer_StreamCreate flag)
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetPositionEx
+* Splitter buffer positioning
+	BASS_Split_StreamResetEx
+* Splitter buffer level retrieval
+	BASS_Split_StreamGetAvailable
+* Splitter buffer length limit increased to 10 seconds
+	BASS_CONFIG_SPLIT_BUFFER
+* Decode-to-position seeking support for mixers and splitters
+	BASS_POS_DECODETO (BASS_ChannelSetPosition flag)
+* Fix for potential splitter resetting deadlock
+	BASS_Split_StreamReset
+
+2.4.4 - 4/2/2010
+----------------
+* Fix for a bug that could result in a mixer source ending a fraction early
+
+2.4.3 - 14/12/2009
+------------------
+* Envelope sync fix
+	BASS_SYNC_MIXER_ENVELOPE (BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetSync type)
+* Thread-safety fix
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelRemove
+
+2.4.2 - 4/9/2009
+----------------
+* Matrix mixing example
+	SPEAKERS example added
+* Splitter stream example
+	MULTI example added
+
+2.4.1 - 19/12/2008
+------------------
+* Splitting into multiple streams
+	BASS_Split_StreamCreate
+	BASS_Split_StreamGetSource
+	BASS_Split_StreamReset
+	BASS_CONFIG_SPLIT_BUFFER (BASS_SetConfig option)
+* Mixer output limiting to the amount of data available from a source
+	BASS_MIXER_LIMIT (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex flag)
+
+2.4 - 2/4/2008
+--------------
+* Attribute envelopes
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetEnvelope
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetEnvelopePos
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetEnvelopePos
+	BASS_MIXER_NODE
+	BASS_SYNC_MIXER_ENVELOPE (BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetSync type)
+* Adjustable resampling filtering
+	BASS_MIXER_FILTER (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex flag)
+	BASS_CONFIG_MIXER_FILTER (BASS_SetConfig option)
+* Source level/data retrieval
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetData
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetLevel
+	BASS_MIXER_BUFFER (BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannel/Ex flag)
+	BASS_CONFIG_MIXER_BUFFER (BASS_SetConfig option)
+* Immediate resuming of a stalled mixer upon a new/unpaused source
+	BASS_MIXER_RESUME (BASS_Mixer_StreamCreate flag)
+* Support for position "modes"
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetPosition
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelGetPosition
+* 64-bit channel start & length settings
+	BASS_Mixer_StreamAddChannelEx
+* Support for all source sync types
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetSync
+* Mixer channel type added
+	BASS_CTYPE_STREAM_MIXER
+* Version retrieval
+	BASS_Mixer_GetVersion
+* Callback "user" parameters changed to pointers
+	BASS_Mixer_ChannelSetSync
+
+2.3 - 30/7/2007
+---------------
+* First release
+
+
+Bug reports, Suggestions, Comments, Enquiries, etc
+==================================================
+If you have any of the aforementioned, please visit the BASS forum at the
+website.
+
